setAppuieSurAjouterUneDepense: "Cindezela «Engeza indleko» kudeshibhodi, uveze inani elikhishwe ekheshini nesizathu esingahlanganisiwe.", setLassistantPeutMaiderAvecQuoi: "Umsizi angangisiza ngani?", setDemandeluiTesVentesTonStock: "Umbuze ngokuthengisa kwakho, isitoko sakho, izikweletu zakho, noma iseluleko sebhizinisi — uyayazi idatha yangempela yesitolo sakho. Ungakhuluma futhi esikhundleni sokuthayipha usebenzisa inkinobho yemakrofoni.", setPuisjeGarderPlusieursDiscussions: "Ngingayigcina yini iminingi imibono?", setOuiAppuieSurLiconeHistorique: "Yebo — cindezela isithonjana somlando ukuze ubone izingxoxo zakho zangaphambilini, phina ezibalulekile, ziqambe kabusha noma uzisuse.", setCompteAbonnement: "I-akhawunti nokubhalisela", setJaiOublieMonMotDe: "Ngikhohlwe iphasiwedi yami, ngenzeni?", setAppuieSurCodePinOublie: "Cindezela «Ikhohliwe ikhodi ye-PIN» esikrinini sokungena, noma ubhalele ukusekelwa nge-WhatsApp ngenhla.", setQuelleEstLaDifference: "Yini umehluko phakathi kwephasiwedi nekhodi ye-PIN?", setLaReponseDifference: "Iphasiwedi yakho isetshenziselwa ukungena ku-app kudivayisi. Ikhodi ye-PIN isetshenziselwa kuphela ukuvikela idatha yakho ebucayi (ibhalansi, izikweletu) — zombili zihlukile futhi ziyaphelelanisa.", setCommentDebloquerLesFonctionnalitesPay: "Ngingazivula kanjani izici ezikhokhelwayo?", setContacteLeSupportPourOrganiser: "Xhumana nokusekelwa ukuze uhlele inkokhelo; i-akhawunti yakho izovulwa ngesandla ngemuva kwalokho.", setMesDonneesSontellesEnSecurite: "Ingabe idatha yami iphephile?", setTonMotDePasseNest: "Iphasiwedi yakho ayilondolozwa ngombhalo ovulekile, futhi idatha yakho yokuthengisa/isitoko ihlala ixhunywe ne-akhawunti yakho kuphela.", setPuisjeChangerLaDeviseDe: "Ngingayishintsha yini uhlobo lwemali yesitolo sami kamuva?", setOuiAToutMomentDans: "Yebo, noma nini ku-Izilungiselelo > Isikhombakhomba > Uhlobo lwemali. Amanani abonakala nje kuhlobo lwemali olusha, ngaphandle kokuguqulwa.", setVersion: "Inguqulo", setMaBoutiqueEstUneAp